    24	- **Compact posture:** the file reads *Status: active non-compliance, observation priority escalated.* Asset-restriction is *pending jurisdiction*: it will be served within the hour if any one of the four enrolled names is written in a book inside a district. The last watcher turned back at the provincial marker. The author of the fifth file line is unnamed, and no office is named on it. Vastin remains inside as Archmarshal / the certifying office and returned the closing summary without annotation. Gault remains evaluator of record. [B6-reconciled 2026-10-11: audit C3, D5]
    25	- **Quiet ground:** unknown to every one of them. Nobody has heard the words.
    26	- **The last line:** "nothing anywhere was deciding what he was, except him."
