   366	All reads on Sol (gpt-5.6-sol): editorial (three bounded priorities), cold read (three clarity items), source-distance (6 tracked passages, no dense scene), plan / canon / protected-text audit (ten local line fixes — applied by the coordinator, one corrected: it is Pike, not Teague, who struck the ford off the hold). Sixteen of the author's 21 flags KEEP; five amended by line fix. Same-author repair r1 in progress when this block was written; the CLOSED note follows when the recheck returns.
