   653	- **The mule (C2, flag):** left with the crew on the 110th. She goes on the low side of nothing and the driver on the low side of her; she will not cross moving water with anybody on her near hand; her near hind has been shod since the Oxhollow road; she answers to a click; she has never had a name and is not to be given one. Oryn takes the off pannier on her own back and the spare rope, thirty feet of three-strand, for the next gate's jenny.
