   684	**Hounds.** Unchanged: seven unaccounted for since the 96th. Nothing has come up to Thornwater's white stone since the ford (fifty-seven evenings on the 110th).
   685	
   686	**Who knows what.** The mechanism: **six.** That he knew at noon on the 96th that the fragments answered inside: the six. That he has read himself and found something: the six know that there is a thing; none knows what. The Quieting, by that name: the six. The hold, Pike, the carter, the clerk and the west know that six went in and six came out. Nobody has put a verb between a made floor, an age with no ruler, and a boy.
   687	
   688	**Open threads.** Two more readings, and a telling owed on her day. A question that she will not answer. A place that does not move. A count of kinds that wants a second floor. Two rings marked *guess* and a round that nobody can place. "One at a time, for money." A stake numbered thirty-one. A report eight days gone west. An arm slung until the snow; an ankle that nobody has mended; a bow that she can shoot and cannot span. A mule that is not theirs. Three unanswered letters and a parcel on a ferry somewhere.
