   536	### Coordinator rulings (binding)
   537	- **Deployment since the Line: THIRTEEN.** One at the ford (day 53) and twelve in the Ring on the night of the 96th, each priced and billed in the night log: Iron read; Shadow (once, ten strides); Wind; Pressure; Ember (one point on the knife's tip); Blade (an edge on Lira's knife); Anchor (perception only — a deliberate release counts); Storm lanes one, two and three (ten / ten / twelve counts; the body read lost while the air is held); Wind a second time; Compression at contact, late. The two noon tests of the 96th are left out of the number, unexplained. All capability rules held.
