    66	6. **Four bolts into the pale.** Lira from the wall-top, the stock across her knee and her shoulder against the coping: one; Seln spans; two. The thing rolls and her line is gone; Seln has it from the north wall: he takes the bow, spans and shoots twice. Cael lets the point go; the jaws close on water; it lets go and goes down, alive. Out, moving. `[[TIER-B: "Walls… Twelve sheets."]]`. It is left there.
