383:### B9. The deployment count and Shadow-use count need final seam fields
389:**Edition evidence:** deployment since the Line is thirteen at closed M6; Shadow has been used exactly once and resealed (`B7 ledger:537–538,619,664`). Book 7’s planned Stair use would make Shadow exactly twice, but it is not canon yet. Book 8 plans three acquisitions, reaching thirteen; the series trajectory remains nineteen before Book 10 and twenty-two by Book 10, with the Book 9 additions deliberately open (`BOOK_MAP.md:270,443`).
391:**Amendment:** after Book 7 closes, write these two explicit entry lines:
