404:**Edition evidence:** Teague’s crew is deliberately unnamed in Book 7 and Book 8 planning (`B7 ledger:626`; `BOOK_MAP.md:151`; `MOVEMENT-008.md:8`). `OWNER-DECISIONS.md` contains no approved name for the young one. Saying a name once but “never writing” it still requires the author to mint a spoken name.
