+# 8. Book 8 Movement 1 inheritance and B7 reconciliation-audit disposition
+
+## Complete inherited seam
+
+Book 8 Movement 1 must inherit all of the following from surviving prose, whether or not its packet presently carries it:
+
+- **Opening instant and place:** morning of day 131 at Lowmarch's lower-inn hearth; first snow began day 129, last ferry ran day 130, hauling ropes are in, and a hand's depth lies on day 131 (`manuscript/chapter-59.md:127-145`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:31,47-95,221-225`).
+- **Party locations:** Cael, Lira, Brom, Karis, and Seln are at the lower inn, with the warm store behind the chimney for the archive; Oryn is at Thornwater and her letter asks them after the thaw to bring the map; Teague's unnamed four practitioners plus the unnamed older healer are at Lowmarch for the cold term (`manuscript/chapter-59.md:221-247`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:3-25,131-217,221-237`).
+- **Cael:** nineteen; ten fragments; final deployment **twenty-seven after fixes**; Shadow used exactly twice and sealed; Anchor used twice, once each way; Tide has read Oryn twice in all, each by leave; Cael has read himself three times and has not touched the still place since Oryn's order (`manuscript/chapter-55.md:169-301`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:29-41`). His Hall rib bill goes quiet on day 129 (`manuscript/chapter-59.md:49-51`).
+- **Still place/debt:** old private label, now a located and spoken finding; under the breastbone; nothing moves; all ten go round and none through; no piling; not the Quiet; not a fragment; older than the log; Oryn heard all of it at once while granting the reading of her body, declared the three-and-telling debt paid, withheld forgiveness and her old answer, and ordered it written and left alone (`manuscript/chapter-55.md:169-297`; `manuscript/chapter-57.md:191-209`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:39`). All six know the finding; only the six know the mechanism (`manuscript/chapter-57.md:191-209`).
+- **Lira:** left arm slung high, eight marks taken, holding nothing until Oryn says; right ankle taped and never mended; Oryn's spanned crossbow on its strap with one bolt, and Lira cannot span it (`manuscript/chapter-58.md:17-27`; `manuscript/chapter-59.md:25-37`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:231-237`).
+- **Brom:** right shoulder mended twice, then bound in four yards of webbing with a drover's turn; no third mending; knot to await the older healer; he accepted the forty-mark axe-head fence (`manuscript/chapter-55.md:3-37`; `manuscript/chapter-56.md:35-61`; `manuscript/chapter-59.md:235-247`).
+- **Karis/research:** Ember, Iron Rank Three; voice whole; 52 sheets split 11/29/12; forty-one kinds at the Ring/Stair and thirty-three seen on the sampled Hall wall; four copies of the three-site leaf; carter's map with four unlabeled/aligned circles; Ternhall straightedge; kit field ledger; hypothesis unspoken and unentered (`manuscript/chapter-57.md:3-87`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:17-27,239-255`).
+- **Seln:** Shadow, Bronze; unmarked; case shut and on its strap; field ledger given to Karis; Shadow source still protected from Oryn; he has not decoded the index or stroke-and-bar and has supplied no forbidden date (`manuscript/chapter-59.md:55-123`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:239-255`).
+- **Fourth site/alignment:** four sites lie on one map alignment; the first three centres are true under both brass edges in Cael's hand; the fourth is about 440 yards in radius, ringed by iron stakes numbered 34 with stroke-and-bar, one pace apart, not entered, unnamed, Path effect unknown, with an ambiguous standing grey silhouette; the line continues off the hide (`manuscript/chapter-58.md:117-229`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:239-255`). Only the exact protected maker statements survive.
+- **Board/work:** five names remain eleventh; nine completed lines; no number on the first-snow season line; Stair price says “three hundred; taken; not paid”; Teague's exact term is “After the thaw. Whatever's on that bearing. My crew comes.”; the five take the forty-mark fence, whose day's posts and far side remain to do (`manuscript/chapter-59.md:167-247`). Teague's four-mark weir slip remains forfeited after fix 8.
+- **Money/accounts:** ninety-six living-purse marks (102 less six); sealed cart-and-gelding reserve still unopened in the third box; Fallow hundred and Stair three hundred remain in Pike's box and are not crew-payable debts; ferryman is owed sixty yards of four-strand rope, not wanted before thaw; fence not begun (`manuscript/chapter-52.md:357`; `manuscript/chapter-59.md:145-157,175-179,241-247`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:7-11,31`).
+- **Objects:** three boxes; kit case/cord/stake 32/mallet on the back-room table after fix 18; kit ledger beside it; 52 sheets; map; Ternhall and Hesk brass straightedges; Hesk's satchel/log/old volume/notebook; Seln's shut case; brown mule with the five; grey jenny with Oryn; Oryn's bow/hook/one bolt with Lira; four spent bolts in the Hall (`manuscript/chapter-54.md:269-317`; `manuscript/chapter-58.md:23-27,59`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:15-25,59-75`).
+- **Letters:** Hesk's parcel/straightedge arrived; Cael sent Hesk and Vell replies west, including Vell's “session still stands”; Ephram remains unanswered but is promised the first thaw boat; Oryn's exact bark letter is carried in Hesk's satchel and needs no answer (`manuscript/chapter-60.md:59-89,213-227`). The clerk's packet says only that the crew kept the kit (`manuscript/chapter-60.md:87-89`). OWNER #25's Lira-family line remains opaque and receives no new setup.
+- **Knowledge limits/open pressure:** Teague/Pike/holds/Compact do not know the mechanism or that fragments work inside; Oryn knows sources by Path but not Seln as Shadow source; no theory connects the sites, still place, or Cael; the cordon has no watch-post or date; the central shape has no name; the line runs off the map; the unanswered questions are twice-size effect, who/why, the unopened case, the archive index/mark, Ephram's reply, the rope, and Oryn's withheld answer (`manuscript/chapter-56.md:155-197`; `manuscript/chapter-58.md:117-229`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:85-89,239-267`).
