+
+# 5. Protected text
+
+## Source-chapter 21–24 audit
+
+- **Ch21/Hall:** all mapped units occur once and in order across `manuscript/chapter-53.md:111-131,173,279,325-377`, `chapter-54.md:63,115-119,183,245`, and `chapter-55.md:63-79`. The missing source sentence is `"Walls," Karis said, from the coping. "I've the walls. Twelve sheets."` (source `chapter-21.md:177`): Karis speaks from the coping to Brom and the crew in answer to “What did we get?” Fixes 3–4 restore it and its retrospective join (`manuscript/chapter-54.md:319-323`). The “Twice” unit runs through `and he didn't.` (source `chapter-21.md:185`); fix 5 restores that exact end.
