+PASS. No person, place, or animal receives a name not supplied by the plan. Teague's spear, bow, boy, and older healer; the hide carter; ferryman and boy; innkeeper; old woman and grandson; carters; courier; steading people; and both mules remain unnamed (`manuscript/chapter-56.md:29-61,71-139`; `manuscript/chapter-58.md:3-59`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:3-9,47-61,131-189`). The fourth site is never named (`manuscript/chapter-58.md:117-229`). This also satisfies OWNER #24: Oryn's brown mule remains with the crew, while she takes Millrace's unnamed grey jenny north (`manuscript/chapter-47.md:229-243`; `manuscript/chapter-58.md:3,37-59`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:99-135`). OWNER #25 remains intentionally unresolved: Movement 8 adds no setup for Book 8's protected line about Lira's family (`manuscript/chapter-60.md:77-85`).
