+# 4. Standing defaults
+
+- **Calendar language PASS.** No named season, named month/month order, or English weekday occurs in chapters 53–60. Generic `season`, `cold term`, `thaw`, `first snow`, and literal water `spring` are permitted (`manuscript/chapter-54.md:29`; `manuscript/chapter-55.md:29`; `manuscript/chapter-59.md:127,189`; `manuscript/chapter-60.md:5,31`).
+- **Units PASS.** Distances use yards, feet, hands, paces, strides, furlongs, miles, and cords; no metric unit occurs (`manuscript/chapter-53.md:151,223,353,363`; `manuscript/chapter-58.md:69-75,193-195`).
+- **Kindling/age PASS.** Cael is nineteen and no numeric span since Kindling is stated (`manuscript/chapter-60.md:29-31`; `manuscript/chapter-58.md:229`).
+- **No-Path language PASS.** Outside grandfathered protected text, narration never calls a Path Cael's; the closing correctly says his ten things “aren't a Path” (`manuscript/chapter-60.md:257`).
+- **Reader Standard PASS.** The reported FK grade is 3.56 (`AUTHOR-REPORT.md:11,27-41`), and action, bills, and abstractions remain legible to a thirteen-year-old reader (`manuscript/chapter-54.md:57-71,179-247`; `manuscript/chapter-55.md:49-57`).
+- **OWNER #51 PASS.** Movement 8 neither explains nor reinterprets “Tomorrow makes three” from closed `manuscript/chapter-44.md:219`; the closing's “walked into the quiet three times and come out” remains its own protected count (`manuscript/chapter-60.md:257`).
